    <monstergroupdescription>
      <p>
	Wild Men o' the Moor are a smaller sub-race of Boggart. They are small,
	about <m05/> high frog-men.  They infest moors, swamps, sewer systems
	and any wet place. Though hateful of human-kind, they are not openly
	aggressive unless they outnumber their opponents.
      </p>
